[
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 1,
    "text": "有家公司只赚你一次钱。却要替你守一辈子的 DNA。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 2,
    "text": "吉列卖你一把剃须刀。以后还能不断卖刀片。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 3,
    "text": "这家公司不一样。它卖出的产品，你一辈子可能只买一次。它就是 23andMe。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 4,
    "text": "你往试管里吐点口水，再把它寄回去。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 5,
    "text": "它能告诉你来自哪里。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 6,
    "text": "还可能找到你的亲戚。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 7,
    "text": "甚至提示遗传健康风险。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 8,
    "text": "听起来很酷。问题是，DNA 基本不会变。测过一次以后，为什么还要测第二次？",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 9,
    "text": "顾客只付一次钱。但公司要长期保存数据。那是世界上最敏感的数据，也永远换不了。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "chapter": "one-sale-lifetime-duty",
    "step": 10,
    "text": "一次收入，永久责任。这个商业模式很性感，但第一天就埋着一颗雷。",
    "audio": "one-sale-lifetime-duty/10.mp3"
  }
]
